[[31,63,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p><a href=\"#/3025724\">7010M10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025704\">7010C44</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025720\">7010E11</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025603\">5570T96</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025692\">7010A04</a></p><p>1. Undo the bolt securing the door check strap to the body.</p><p>2. Undo the nuts fixing the check strap to the door.</p><p>3. Remove the door opening limiter.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2005161.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[31,63,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Check that the check strap\nand seal are not damaged.</p><p>Fit the check strap in its seat.</p><p>Tighten the nuts fixing the check strap\nto the door to the recommended torque.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Nut</p></td><td><p>REAR DOOR OPENING LIMITER</p></td><td><p>M6</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>0.95</p></td></tr></table></div><p>Tighten the bolt fixing the check strap\nto the bodyshell to the recommended torque.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Bolt</p></td><td><p>REAR DOOR OPENING LIMITER</p></td><td><p>M8</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>1.5</p></td></tr></table></div><p>Lubricate the check strap with the specified\nproduct.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001236.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Type</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Qty.</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Grease</p></td><td><p>REAR DOOR OPENING LIMITER</p></td><td><p>MR2/CX FIAT</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>-</p></td></tr></table></div><p><a href=\"#/3025692\">7010A04</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025603\">5570T96</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025720\">7010E11</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025704\">7010C44</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025724\">7010M10</a></p>"]]